  "notes": "Three copies of the same back-view pinout (board silkscreen ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.8). Silkscreen IOxx names recorded first in functions; callout GPIO names used as labels. The two separate pads to the right of the header are silkscreened IO19/IO20; callout lines map USB_P(GPIO20) to the upper pad and USB_N(GPIO19) to the lower pad. BAT and RTC connectors have only +/- marks and are skipped."
